{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "71b37a1831d065007153f8d58d9db43b123a6a8642c42447c87e3c17c0e2977a", "ja": "超必殺！　ウルトラショット！！", "zh": "超级必杀技！究极杀球！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "17443882ae1df37d618eee4a1dd768ecdf9d7d42dbacbf379b1d0be020004c76", "ja": "撮影も佳境。情熱が高まりすぎてアドリブを\n連発しまくるアイドルたちだったが、監督は\n大喜びで、このままお願いしますと告げる。\n熱く躍動するアイドル達のスーパーな演技に\nプロデューサーは成功を確信するのだった。", "zh": "拍摄渐入佳境。偶像们越演越投入，\n不断加入即兴表演，却让导演非常满意，\n表示希望她们照着这个样子继续拍下去。\n见到偶像们热情跃动所展现的超级演技，\n制作人坚信电影必能获得成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "51d3161e1378258efae91c74465062aeeb741b70f495ea9f2cda8089961d4bb1", "ja": "（ついに撮影も佳境だ……一度は風花に敗れた海美たち\nだが、厳しい練習を経て、地区予選で再戦に挑む）", "zh": "（进度终于来到全剧高潮……海美等人一度败给风花，\n但在经历艰辛的练习后，再度挑战地区预赛。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1001_p", "source_sha256": "f7a68ecaefe97006d2d2a2566581cdddc631150e285955530d4e0956a888e0fd", "ja": "（決勝まで勝ち進む海美＆紗代子姉妹だが、クイーンの\n容赦ない攻撃によって、紗代子が倒れてしまう……）", "zh": "（海美和纱代子姊妹打进了决赛，\n但在女王毫不留情的攻击之下，纱代子倒下了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1002_staff", "source_sha256": "06f93f7da37d7e09a0cf1816ca70889e3e728e8aca8ad1af855f4d835093674c", "ja": "準備、いいですか？　それじゃ、始めまーす！\n3……2……、……カチン！", "zh": "准备好了吗？那么要开始拍了～！\n3……2…………喀锵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "f9110bf8273d855c82144b335b4c2aa0b56431164f397d1fcb887d28db693d51", "ja": "ぐ、うっ……海美……。\nごめんね、私……もう、動けないみたい……。", "zh": "咕、呜……海美……\n对不起，我……好像、已经动不了了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "d9109b74ff08d9c72f175dacdcc2ccb2932bc48ba00731021d70a09ffa1fcd3c", "ja": "お姉ちゃん！？　お姉ちゃんっ！", "zh": "姊姊！？姊姊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "ab6d1dc5d978edeaf28e34f46912b3cc909e00e9f59994d6e24b20983a318c37", "ja": "悔しいなぁ……やっと、海美と一緒のコートに\n立てたのに……やっと一緒に、プレーできるのに……！", "zh": "好不甘心……我好不容易、能和海美站上同一个球场……\n好不容易、终于可以一起打球……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1006_037nao", "source_sha256": "31f5c546c4e2dc7b8eed002b8a7140981b9935567086314434d34c6e48bb2e6d", "ja": "なんや、またメロドラマかいな……。ま、ええわ。\n負傷のタイムアウトは5分やったっけ？", "zh": "搞什么，又在演肥皂剧呀……哎，算了。\n伤停时间是5分钟对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1007_037nao", "source_sha256": "d5559a9f731bd8710482d54edbc2d65f457eb9017a54c196a38844278299320e", "ja": "なら5分は待ったる。せいぜい後悔したらええ。\n私らに挑んだことをな……ククク！", "zh": "那我就等你们5分钟，让你们后悔个够吧。\n后悔来挑战我们……呵呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d3acb36d304052e60dd9023f0ca83f9190cb0f3ab09ef1b96abc2b1158f1c3c5", "ja": "これで終わり？　そう……。\n今年も、つまらない夏になりそうね。", "zh": "到此为止了吗……？\n看来今年夏天也很无趣呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "5e41d8c1fb1e32e23c87125738a1edc5a648c1bd9f305adf8c495249cf99f344", "ja": "ごめんね、海美……約束、守れなくて……。\nふたりで……表彰台に……上がろうって……。", "zh": "对不起，海美……我没能遵守约定……\n明明说好要两个人……一起……站上颁奖台的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "4e764d99840b7b9156285e68486e72cb1ad2129bdcabe529f8b535a295cb6877", "ja": "やめてよ……謝らないでよ！\n私がケガさえさせなかったら……お姉ちゃんは……！", "zh": "别这样……不要道歉啦！\n要是我没有害姊姊受伤……姊姊就……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "bfd8133f5aa6562e1733526b73efd1aeac01debb9b711c85998bf19d801afd18", "ja": "でも、私……楽しかったよ……。\n1秒でも長く……続けたかったけど……。", "zh": "但是我……很开心喔……\n虽然我还想再打久一点……再多一秒也好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "6c4cd643090e286f882649dcc915731bc05c51fd509161d4bd61fcd22cfe220a", "ja": "私は、ここまでだね……。\nあとは、お願い………………恵美ちゃんっ……！", "zh": "但我似乎是到此为止了呢……\n接下来，就拜托你了………………惠美……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1013_020meg", "source_sha256": "ada18d6ee26a48fd2c30fe51411fe09a844a3c7ccb33dc94fd7777c8c808bd60", "ja": "うんっ！　センパイは、安心してゆっくり休んで！\nアタシが……海美を守るから！", "zh": "嗯！学姊就放心休息吧！\n我会……保护海美的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1014_037nao", "source_sha256": "4fe1bc8f56e1c3bfa6c452bd192a1f6eda53c3fe2dd9310cb550c16ee174cc40", "ja": "はぁ……？　あの新米が、紗代子の代わりやて？\n時間稼ぎもたいがいにせえよ！", "zh": "啊……？那个新人要代替纱代子上场？\n想拖时间也别用这么可笑的方式呀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c3934ab1fe9dff86775185b391fe5843e15ef653aa6fa289cd5d0e4f086663ef", "ja": "時間稼ぎ……それはどうかしら。", "zh": "拖时间……真是如此吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1016_037nao", "source_sha256": "6055ef8df9d9eed40269c1338ad102e2a9b08220800952bc0170f327ac50f321", "ja": "なんて？\nキング、それはどういう……！", "zh": "什么？\n王者，那是什么意思……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1017_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d4f93c55b98f29cddb3c2b90bb5b57111ba9854a3b89502f864055400be69cd3", "ja": "感じないの？　クイーン。\n大気を震わせる、このバレー力の高まりを……。", "zh": "女王，你没有感觉到吗？\n这股高涨的排球之力，正震撼着大气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1018_037nao", "source_sha256": "80134deeb0f747ecd62331dbdf5aeba9e25c9aa03b11b0624ff868f9f5e31084", "ja": "はっ！？　なんや、このバレー力……！\nこんなん地区予選のレベルやないで！", "zh": "啊！？这股排球之力是怎么回事……！\n这哪里是地区预赛的水准啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1019_041fuk", "source_sha256": "85e7e245413a0d3973b4d25cd292438f81e0382967dd8f8674a5c30b7a84e1a5", "ja": "ふふっ、やっと本気で戦えるのかしら……。\nすぐ倒れたりしたら、許さないわよ？", "zh": "呵呵，终于能认真对战了吗……\n要是你弱得不堪一击，我可不会原谅你喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "4191d3db792c29179e3956ff4b89186c3827d6d950cdd4fa565cf688fff788d2", "ja": "海美、アタシ……こんなときで、悪いんだけど……。\nワクワクしてる。負ける気がしないんだ。", "zh": "海美，我……很抱歉，在这种时候……\n我却很兴奋，不觉得我们会输。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "68b307afb7e4c1f90ae8f1f7392b345a88365355de11a671cf5afe07f3107336", "ja": "そうだね……私も、そんな気がする。\n待たせたね、キング、クイーン……見せてやるよ。", "zh": "对啊……我也这么觉得。\n让你们久等了，王者，女王……就让你们见识看看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1022_029umi", "source_sha256": "8cdc80e936824829d10e0153fbf2108f2e50d89da16e79a1039d1a505488f23f", "ja": "私たちの、全力っ！！", "zh": "我们的全力！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1023_020meg", "source_sha256": "8cdc80e936824829d10e0153fbf2108f2e50d89da16e79a1039d1a505488f23f", "ja": "私たちの、全力っ！！", "zh": "我们的全力！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1024_null", "source_sha256": "a1269628ae1a31b7c3027a5c36e0f5ec7f2b4dcc51bd33ce7866202fe4c2df78", "ja": "休憩中……", "zh": "休息中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1025_p", "source_sha256": "200e2a3f0610f85adf6770d21973432929a8cc489404acc25afef62bb2c62e52", "ja": "（うん、まさに熱演というべきだな！　ただ……）", "zh": "（嗯，真是充满热情的表演！只不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1026_029umi", "source_sha256": "120c4c5ffb8497dc9f1b415d813f9a708c2c296f63bf69983639c4adef21667d", "ja": "{$P$}、お疲れさまっ！\nねえねえ、どうだった！？　私たちの演技！", "zh": "{$P$}，辛苦了！\n欸欸，你觉得怎么样啊！？我们的演技！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1027_p", "source_sha256": "63fc79817f3067cf4842f5dfdfcdb976f4b7ebbd750fcf87a2bdfbbb1a3b85b9", "ja": "ああ、すごかったぞ！　手に汗握ったよ。\nただ、演技は問題ないんだが……。", "zh": "嗯，很厉害喔！我都看得手心冒汗了。\n只是，虽然演技方面没有问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1028_027say", "source_sha256": "92e8d6566ee973eabfa1de04d75362cc0e27dd93f00637d5f20766a2ba9b2865", "ja": "あ、やっぱり、ダメでしたか！？\nアドリブ、入れすぎでしたよね……！", "zh": "啊，果然不行吗！？\n我是不是加太多即兴发挥进去了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1029_p", "source_sha256": "2734510349081c8e9f3c7d22bf0bab0147e374da9b2a388a96e3a19856309cae", "ja": "そうだな、ちょっと……。\nいや、かなり……。", "zh": "对啊，有一点……\n不，是非常……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1030_020meg", "source_sha256": "128df4be296123b6176bb298b6e0f48d1275554314c87779be284884eb72741c", "ja": "みんな、メッチャ入れてたよね！\nアタシもつられて熱が入っちゃって、まいったな～。", "zh": "大家都加了很多即兴表演呢！\n连我也跟着激动起来了，真伤脑筋～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1031_041fuk", "source_sha256": "a364f413e6516df62a03a05742d93c43b2ff3ec63f7a57f8901633aa1cc8a6c5", "ja": "私も、キングらしくしようと思って、つい……。\nそれに、大胆すぎたかも？　うう～っ……！", "zh": "我也想说要更有王者风范，就不小心……\n而且我是不是放得太开了？呜呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1032_037nao", "source_sha256": "c79976e0b09e886c43cfd1b791db02c68b70688e0e21229b61ce61eb537032ae", "ja": "尺、倍ぐらいになってますよね？　絶対アカンやん！\nリテイクでは、もっと抑えてかんとな～……。", "zh": "刚才那段的长度多了一倍左右吼？这样绝对不行啊！\n重拍时得更克制一点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1033_kantoku", "source_sha256": "8d37d4da4d244b001c425b4a158c9d963483ee75fa0615dcbf17eeb6ff220985", "ja": "765プロのみなさん、お疲れさまです！\n今、ちょっといいですか？", "zh": "765艺能的各位，大家辛苦了！\n可以借我说几句话吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1034_p", "source_sha256": "af5156b6c7c377e199364000101804d85385990642b4246b3835bb75f4c14c22", "ja": "あっ、お、お疲れさまです！　すみません、\nうちの子たちの演技が、先走ってしまって……！", "zh": "啊，您、您也辛苦了！不好意思，\n我们的偶像演得太入迷了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1035_kantoku", "source_sha256": "febf7690e843117020d2cc68153b4e379413c58e0298749d70fbfb24f43bf1de", "ja": "ああ、そのことなんですが……。", "zh": "喔，关于这点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1036_kantoku", "source_sha256": "d7948596a2f62d2d6276177609bcec57d7e4b5ae3fb355807eee8fda7004ce9e", "ja": "いやー、すばらしいっ！　最高ですよ！\n私も助監も脚本家も、みんなそろって大喜びです！", "zh": "哎呀～真是太棒了！很完美！\n我、副导演还有编剧，全都非常高兴！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1037_p", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1038_kantoku", "source_sha256": "4a40a419bfb64648a761f45f0940672ec154c90b45be043ce12ea403d8f328ea", "ja": "引き続きこの調子で、お願いしますね！\n尺は気にしないで、後でつまみますから！　それじゃ！", "zh": "后续也麻烦各位照着这个方式继续拍下去了！\n不用在意片长，之后会再剪短的！就这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1039_029umi", "source_sha256": "4f79819f7450b31dfe93ee97e801b26a2dfa00f2d92d51330735e8b82261ea3d", "ja": "やったーっ☆　私たちの演技、認めてもらえたんだ！\nもっともっと熱くやっていいんだねっ！", "zh": "太棒了──☆我们的演技获得认可了！\n还可以再更更更～热血下去是吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1040_020meg", "source_sha256": "c49773fe1131f73544275d1b01116e0c07d08987e19b32f21972a9a397146443", "ja": "にゃははっ♪　やろうやろう！\nアタシもここまできたら、ハンパなのはイヤだしね！", "zh": "呀哈哈♪上吧上吧！\n我也是，都到这一步了，可不想妥协啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1041_p", "source_sha256": "073b94b30a0fb4f7e6c5a062d2befcbc0bb024f7eef1142ff1d3b93b0f7b4225", "ja": "ああ、遠慮しないで、全部出し切っていこう！", "zh": "嗯，不用客气，去使出浑身解数吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1042_029umi", "source_sha256": "9c4c2128d7be5ec963c39a1b3eb099e5e7b53fef07f17f53c6eb617af9695248", "ja": "はいっ☆", "zh": "好的☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1043_020meg", "source_sha256": "9bee1fe06cb5231d6fb5fa2ee7d4af79926b7a1bf612297e254e51acd62885ae", "ja": "はい♪", "zh": "好的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1044_027say", "source_sha256": "f4c4a95beb3f5469d8b2867e8c5aed8feb9b28112f9a5d88e9a41e3439e07b34", "ja": "はいっ！！", "zh": "好的！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1045_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1046_037nao", "source_sha256": "3f3f2a97db294c531013c4a22f6b20a34404295c0ff263be380020c749d01d1d", "ja": "は～い！", "zh": "好的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1048_029umi", "source_sha256": "b751eaafbee3dc79c6a519148f5c58a0b81f10a433a41e4716a030f42d77a719", "ja": "はぁっ、はぁっ……なんて強さなの、キング……！\nショットが通らないっ……！", "zh": "呼、呼……王者竟然这么强……！\n杀球全都被回击了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1049_020meg", "source_sha256": "57d379c3163b480dadeebd13f8d9a9ce46a8419f7c8f6dc8c8a3ada46d9cc10c", "ja": "はぁ、はぁ……海美！\nこうなったら、アレをやるしかないよ！", "zh": "呼、呼……海美！\n既然如此，就只能使出那招了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1050_029umi", "source_sha256": "9bf4432663acbec5cbd36ce77af4bebf2c2b23cfc8c292172d1bc5ae266e0745", "ja": "恵美！？　ダメだよ、練習で一度も成功してないのに！\nそれに、恵美の腕がもたないでしょ！？", "zh": "惠美！？不行，练习时一次都没成功过呀！\n而且惠美的手臂承受不住吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1051_020meg", "source_sha256": "5f4173a88290b8d53a9392fec9fadbd2056b6677407bc6dc14f007feadc4da80", "ja": "大丈夫！　海美、アタシを信じて！\nアタシたちなら……やれるよっ！", "zh": "没问题的！海美，相信我！\n我们……一定办得到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1052_041fuk", "source_sha256": "6353f37d2e4beae7abb23baeb108fbf157ac907a1f6f287947ec920dbb1abc28", "ja": "ふふっ……クイーンを倒したことは、ほめてあげるわ。\n認めてあげましょう、あなたたちの力を。", "zh": "呵呵……居然能打倒女王，我就称赞你们一下，\n认同你们的力量吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1053_041fuk", "source_sha256": "283bec80fc08568104016b49da9238a6db0e4ad464797966f047ce05fe8f8ab2", "ja": "ここまで戦える相手は、本当に久しぶり。でも……。\nこれで終わりよっ！　はあっ！", "zh": "我真的很久没遇见这么有实力的对手了，但是……\n这下就结束了！喝啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1054_se", "source_sha256": "7adb93ee64a43586fc39ca60699365faf0553deb8448d0a8693a2b2ee3372d8c", "ja": "ドゴーン！！", "zh": "砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1055_020meg", "source_sha256": "254e00e87d821fff9884ffd4fa865223bc570f46643bccb6529c17e7ba1e0bc7", "ja": "くっ……うおおぉーっ！", "zh": "咕……呜喔喔喔──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1056_029umi", "source_sha256": "643d8a6de5131b28f5f28e84afe539368ad397025e4061bcb0789bcf51281764", "ja": "上がった！　恵美……！", "zh": "球来了！惠美……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1057_020meg", "source_sha256": "269e9faae76870654afa0c434f94823a8b3ee96e7b3eabea88abe41343ce17fe", "ja": "さあ、来なよっ、海美！\nアタシが、アンタの……翼になるから！", "zh": "好，来吧，海美！\n我会成为……你的翅膀！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1058_029umi", "source_sha256": "478d41acb992109f789ea1029adc16ecb0f4ac9a033058f57287052930f6190c", "ja": "恵美ーーーーーーーっ！", "zh": "惠美───────！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1059_020meg", "source_sha256": "d5ca0ce50c07d33ca0b2c4b143d7eac801310f8d12b6078840bc69f289e38b87", "ja": "海美ーーーーーーーっ！", "zh": "海美───────！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1060_020meg", "source_sha256": "9846805691579fc4891d18be68f144965f50d05ab7d79004be0336f8e0a3106c", "ja": "めぐみん……！", "zh": "惠美美……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0050_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0050_story_06_1061_029umi", "source_sha256": "edbb4fa3af2cb2b644c59faf47e9e1311d4313fc82fd783f438229215596be06", "ja": "うみみん……！", "zh": "海美美……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
